#==============================================================================================
#
#   tests_fetch_infrastructure_cases - Fetch/Infrastructure's, ReferrerPolicy's and
#   SecureContexts' results pinned to the reference build
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Generated (a test vector table) from the output of a local oracle that runs the
#       reference Ladybird build's Fetch/Infrastructure (data: URLs, bad ports, the nosniff and
#       MIME type blocking checks, timing infos, fetch controllers and params), ReferrerPolicy
#       and SecureContexts on the same inputs (luce-browser-tools,
#       oracles/luce-browser-engine/fetch_http: cases_p2a.txt, oracle.cpp, gen_luce_cases.py
#       p2a). Each case is an operation, its arguments separated by 0x1F, and the oracle's
#       result line; tests_fetch_infrastructure_1 runs the operation and prints its result the
#       way the oracle does.
#
#==============================================================================================

